return ['domain'=>'zinn-translate','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'ha','project-id-version'=>'zinn-translate','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-08T20:38:11+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-08T20:38:11+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Translate'=>'Zinn® Translate','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-translate'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-translate','Publishes this site in every language you choose, on its own web addresses, with translated slugs, metadata, menus, WooCommerce products, hreflang, per-language sitemaps and llms.txt. Translate with your Zinn Digital® plan or with your own provider key.'=>'Yana buga wannan shafin a kowane harshe da ka zaɓa, a kan adireshin yanar gizonsa, tare da ɓangarorin da aka fassara, metadata, menu, samfuran WooCommerce, hreflang, sitemaps na kowane harshe da llms.txt. Fassara tare da tsarin Zinn Digital® ko tare da maɓallin mai ba da sabis naka.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'An adana shi. Rubuta sabon ƙima don maye gurbin shi.','Filter this list…'=>'Tace wannan lissafin...','Filter this list'=>'Tace wannan jerin','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'Babu abin da ya dace da wannan matatar.','Add a row'=>'Ƙara jere','Remove this row'=>'Cire wannan layin','Remove'=>'Cire','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — bayyani','Overview'=>'Bayani Gaba Daya','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'Kowane plugin na Zinn® akan wannan rukunin yanar gizon, da ko yana aiki.','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'Babu buƙatar haɗin intanet don wannan fakitin (plugin).','Open settings'=>'Buɗe saituna','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'Ba ka da izinin canza waɗannan saitunan.','Settings sections'=>'Sashen saituna','Support'=>'Taimako','Save changes'=>'Ajiye canje-canje','Tools'=>'Kayan Aiki','Export settings'=>'Fitar da saituna','Reset to defaults'=>'Sake dawo da tsoffin tsare-tsare','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'Wannan zai dawo da duk wani tsari a kan wannan plugin zuwa ga asalin saitinsa. A ci gaba?','Diagnostics for support'=>'Nazari don tallafi','Import a settings file'=>'Shigo da fayil ɗin saiti','Import'=>'Shigo da shi','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'Fayilolin da aka fitar ba sa ƙunshe da kalmomin sirri, alamomi ko maɓallan API ba — za ku buƙaci shigar da su sake a sabon shafin.','Settings saved.'=>'An adana saitunan.','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'Kowane saitawa a kan wannan plugin ya koma tsohon tsarin sa.','Done.'=>'An gama.','That action is not available.'=>'Ba a samun wannan matakin.','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'Ba a iya karanta wannan fayil ɗin ba. Zaɓi fayil ɗin saituna da aka fitar daga wani kari na Zinn®.','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'Waccan fayil ya yi girma sosai don ya zama fitar da saituna.','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'Wannan fayil ɗin ba fitarwa ba ce ta saitunan Zinn®.','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'An fitar da wannan fayil ɗin ne daga wani plugin (%s) daban, don haka shigo da shi nan zai adana saitunan da wannan plugin ɗin ba ya fahimta.','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'An shigo da saituna %d. Ba a taba sanya kalmomin sirri da maɓallan API a cikin fitarwa ba, don haka a sake shigar da su.' . "\0" . 'An shigo da saituna %d. Ba a haɗa kalmomin sirri da maɓallan API a cikin fitarwa ba, saboda haka a sake shigar da su.','Translate'=>'Fassara','Manual overrides'=>'Gyaran da aka yi da hannu','Sitemaps and URLs'=>'Taswirorin shafin da URLs','General'=>'Gabaɗaya','Who pays for the translation'=>'Way ke biya aikin fassara','Either your Zinn Digital® plan, or an API key of your own. There is no free tier — somebody pays a provider for every word.'=>'Ko dai shirin ku na Zinn Digital®, ko kuma mabudin API naku. Babu wani matakin kyauta — wani ne ke biyan mai ba da sabis kowane kalma.','My Zinn Digital® plan'=>'Tsarin Zinn Digital® dina','My own provider key'=>'Maɓallin mai ba da sabis na kaina','Site ID'=>'ID na Shafin','From your Zinn Digital® dashboard, on this site\'s Translation tab.'=>'Daga kan allon kula na Zinn Digital®, a shafin fassara na wannan rukunin yanar gizon.','Site token'=>'Alamar yanar gizo','Provider'=>'Mai ba da sabis','API key'=>'Mabuɗin API','Your key, billed to you by the provider. It is stored on this site and sent only to them.'=>'Makullin ka, wanda mai ba da sabis ɗin ke cire maka kuɗi a kansa. Ana adana shi a wannan rukunin yanar gizon kuma ana aika shi zuwa gare su kawai.','Model'=>'Samfuri','Leave empty for the cheapest model that does the job well.'=>'Bar shi a fanko don samun mafi arha samfurin da zai yi aikin yadda ya kamata.','This site is written in'=>'An rubuta wannan shafin a cikin','Leave empty to use the site language from WordPress settings.'=>'Bar shi a bude don amfani da yaren shafin daga saitunan WordPress.','Languages to publish'=>'Harsunan da za a buga','Each one gets its own web addresses and its own sitemap. Publish only the languages you want indexed.'=>'Kowanne yana da nasa adiresoshin yanar gizo da kuma nata taswirar shafin. Buga kawai harsunan da kake son a sanya su cikin jerin sunaye.','Translate automatically when I publish or update'=>'Fassara ta atomatik lokacin da na buga ko sabuntawa','Editing a page marks its translations out of date and they are remade in the background. Editing without changing any words costs nothing.'=>'Gyara shafi yana sa fassararsa ta zama ta tsohon lokaci kuma ana sake su a bango. Gyara ba tare da canza ko kalma daya ba baya biyan komai.','What gets translated'=>'Abin da za a fassara','Post types'=>'Nau\'ukan rubutu','Translate the web addresses too'=>'Fassara adreshoshin yanar gizo ma','French visitors get /fr/a-propos/ rather than /fr/about/. The untranslated address keeps working and redirects, so nothing that was indexed breaks.'=>'Baƙi daga Faransa suna samun /fr/a-propos/ maimakon /fr/about/. Adireshin da ba a fassara ba yana ci gaba da aiki kuma yana turawa, don haka babu wani abin da aka tsara da ya lalace.','Translate SEO titles, descriptions and image alt text'=>'Fassara taken SEO, bayani, da hoton alt rubutu','Translate categories and tags'=>'Fassara rabe-rabe da alamomi','Translate navigation menus'=>'Fassara menu na kewayawa','Translate WooCommerce products and attributes'=>'Fassara samfuran WooCommerce da siffofi','Short descriptions, purchase notes, attribute labels and variation descriptions. Prices, SKUs and stored option values are never touched.'=>'Takaitattun bayani, bayanan siyayya, lakabin siffofi da bayanin bambance-bambance. Ba a taba farashi, SKUs da kuma adana zaɓuɓɓukan da aka adana ba.','SEO'=>'SEO','Add hreflang tags'=>'Ƙara alamomin hreflang','Tells search engines these pages are the same page in different languages. Leave this on unless another plugin is already doing it.'=>'Yana gaya wa injunan bincike cewa waɗannan shafuka ɗaya ne a cikin yaruka daban-daban. Bar wannan a kunne sai dai idan wani ƙarin shiri (plugin) yana yin hakan tun riga.','Publish a sitemap for each language'=>'Bugaci da sitemap ga kowane harshe','Publish llms.txt for each language'=>'Bugisa llms.txt ga kowace harshe','A plain-text map of the site that AI answer engines read. They often cannot run JavaScript and may never fetch a sitemap.'=>'Taswirar shafin da ta ƙunshi rubutu kaɗai wacce injinan amsa na AI ke karantawa. Sau da yawa ba za su iya aiwatar da JavaScript ba kuma ƙila ba za su taɓa ɗauko taswirar shafin ba.','Language switcher'=>'Mai sauya harshe','Style'=>'Salo','Colours, spacing and corners are on the Styling tab. Place it with the block, the [zinn_language_switcher] shortcode, or a menu.'=>'Launin, tazara da kusurwoyi suna kan shafin salo (Styling). Saka shi tare da bulo, gajeren lamba (shortcode) na [zinn_language_switcher], ko kuma jeren zaɓi (menu).','Show only these languages'=>'Nuna waɗannan harsuna kaɗai','Leave empty to show every language you publish.'=>'Bar shi ba komai domin nuna kowane harshe da ka wallafa.','Name each language in its own language'=>'Sanya kowane harshe da yarensa','Deutsch rather than German. Somebody who cannot read the current page cannot read "German" either.'=>'Deutsch maimakon German. Wani wanda ba zai iya karanta shafin yanzu ba ba zai iya karanta "German" ba ma.','Show flags'=>'Nuna tutoci','Off by default: a language is not a country, and Arabic and Spanish have no single flag that does not exclude most of their speakers.'=>'A kashe yake a asali: harshe ba ƙasa ba ne, kuma Larabci da Sifaniyanci ba su da tuta guda ɗaya wadda ba za ta cire yawancin masu magana da su ba.','Include the language being read'=>'Haɗa da harshen da ake karantawa','Include the original language'=>'Haɗa da asalin harshen','Add it to this menu'=>'Ƙara shi zuwa wannan menu ɗin','Only the menu you name here. Nothing is added to any other menu on the site.'=>'Menun da ka sanya a nan kawai. Ba a ƙara komai zuwa wani menu a shafin ba.','Accent'=>'Accent','Background'=>'Fage','Text'=>'Rubutu','Corner radius'=>'Radius na kusurwa','Spacing'=>'Sarari tsakanin layuka','Text size'=>'Girman rubutu','Do not add it to a menu'=>'Kada ka ƙara shi a cikin menu','Edit any translation here. An edited translation is kept exactly as you wrote it and is never overwritten when the page is translated again.'=>'Gyara kowane fassara a nan. Ana ajiye fassarar da aka gyara kamar yadda ka rubuta ta kuma ba a taba share ta lokacin da aka sake fassara shafin ba.','Every language'=>'Kowane harshe','Search translations'=>'Bincika fassara','Filter'=>'Tace','Content'=>'Abubuwan ciki','Language'=>'Harshe','Translation'=>'Fassarar','Status'=>'Matsayi','Save'=>'Ajiye','Nothing translated yet. Publish a language and translation starts in the background.'=>'Ba a fassara komai ba tukuna. Yi wallafa yare kuma fassara za ta fara a bango.','These addresses are live. Open any of them to check it, and submit the sitemap index to Google Search Console.'=>'Waɗannan adiresoshin suna raye. Buɗe kowanne daga cikinsu don bincika shi, kuma ka gabatar da fihirisar sitemap zuwa Google.','You are not allowed to edit translations on this site.'=>'Ba a ba ka izinin gyara fassarori a wannan shafin ba.','Edited by you — kept'=>'Wanda kuka gyara — an adana','Source changed — will be redone'=>'An canza asali — za a sake shi','Up to date'=>'An sabunta','Connected'=>'An haɗa','Connecting…'=>'Ana haɗawa…','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'An haɗa, amma wani abu na buƙatar kulawa','Not connected'=>'Ba a haɗa ba','Running on your own account'=>'Ana gudanarwa a kan asusunka','We could not check this'=>'Ba mu iya bincika wannan ba','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'Wannan manzo bai fadi dalili ba. A aika da rahoton bincike kuma za mu duba.','Connection status'=>'Matsayin haɗi','Last checked %s ago.'=>'An bincika karshe tun %s.','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(yana buɗe a sabon shafin)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'Aika da wannan ga goyon bayan Zinn®','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'Wannan shineini abin da za a aika — babu wani abu kuma, kuma babu abin da aka ɓoye. Kalmomin sirrinka, alamomin izini da maɓallan API ba su ciki.','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'Rahoton binciken da za a aika','Copy to clipboard'=>'Kwafi zuwa allo','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'Aika da wannan rahoton ga tallafin Zinn®','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'Mun buɗe tikitin goyon baya don ku kuma mun ba da amsa ta imel. Idan kun fi son kada ku aika da shi, kwafi shi a sama kuma ku liƙa shi a cikin tikiti da kanku.','Copied'=>'An kwafi','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'Ba mu iya isa ga Zinn Digital® ba daga wannan uwar garken (%s). Kwafi rahoton da ke sama sannan ka buɗe tikiti maimakon haka — babu abin da ya lalace game da saitunanka.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'An tura. Taimakon Zinn® yana da rahotonku kuma zai ba da amsa ta imel.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'Taimakon Zinn® ya karɓi rahotonku — lambar tunani %s — kuma zai ba da amsa ta imel.','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'Kun aika da yawa a cikin kankanin lokaci. Jira na ‘yan mintuna sannan ku sake gwadawa — an karɓi na da suka gabata.','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® ta kasa karɓar rahoton a yanzu — wannan kuskurenmu ne, ba naku ba. Sake gwadawa nan ba da jimawa ba, ko kuma ku kwafe rahoton da ke sama zuwa cikin tikiti.','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'An ƙi amincewa da rahoton (HTTP %d). Kwafi shi a sama sannan ka buɗe tikiti, tare da ambaton wannan lamba.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — jagorori da ayyuka','User guides'=>'Jagororin masu amfani','Read the %s user guide'=>'Karanta jagorar mai amfani ta %s','Hide this'=>'Boye da wannan','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Zinn® hosting don WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, goyan bayan kullum, ƙaura kyauta da kuma allon sarrafawa da aka gina don mutanen da ke gudanar da shafuka fiye da ɗaya.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Kasuwancin Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Sayen da siyar da ingantattun shafuka, yankuna, da wuraren sanya hanyoyin sadarwa, tare da ajiyar kudi cikin aminci har sai bangarorin biyu sun gamsu.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — hayar mutanen da ke yin wannan a matsayin sana\'a','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Kasuwar \'yan kwangila ta duniya: bincika fiye da ayyuka 10,000 da aka riga aka shirya daga marubuta, masu zanen kaya, masu haɓakawa da ƙwararrun SEO, ko kuma sanya aiki kuma ku bar su su yi gwanjo.','The API key was rejected. Check that it is still valid and has translation access, then save it again.'=>'An ki amincewa da maɓallin API ɗin. Tabbatar cewa har yanzu yana da inganci kuma yana da izinin fassara, sannan ka sake adana shi.','The provider refused on billing or quota. Nothing was translated. Check the balance and limits on your account with them.'=>'Mai ba da sabis ɗin ya ƙi saboda batun biyan kuɗi ko adadin da aka ba da izini. Ba a fassara komai ba. Duba ma\'aunin kuɗi da iyakoki a kan asusun ku tare da su.','The translation provider is having a problem at their end. Nothing was translated or charged, and it will try again on the next pass.'=>'Mai ba da sabis na fassara na fuskantar matsala a gefensu. Ba a fassara komai ba kuma ba a caje komai ba, kuma zai sake gwadawa a karo na gaba.','The translation request failed and we could not tell why. Nothing was saved.'=>'Omidodin fassarar ya gaza kuma ba mu iya sanin dalili ba. Ba a adana komai ba.','Sitemap index'=>'Manajistar shafi','%s sitemap'=>'%s sitemap','LLM content map'=>'Taswirar abubuwan da ke cikin LLM','%s LLM content map'=>'%s Taswirar abun ciki na LLM','Languages published'=>'Harsunan da aka wallafa','Site language'=>'Harshen rukunin yanar gizo','SEO plugin'=>'Kayan aikin SEO','No translation provider is set up yet.'=>'Ba a saita mai fassarar kowane iri ba tukuna.','Paste an API key from your chosen provider, or connect the site to a Zinn Digital® account, and translation starts on the next pass.'=>'Sanya maballin API daga wanda kuka zaba, ko kuma ku haɗa shafin da asusun Zinn Digital®, kuma fassara za ta fara a zagaye na gaba.','Translating with your own %s key.'=>'Fassara da naka ko naku %s maɓalli.','This site is not connected to a Zinn Digital® account, which is fine — your provider bills you directly.'=>'Wannan shafin bai haɗa da asusun Zinn Digital® ba, wanda hakan ba komai bane — mai ba da sabis ɗinku yana tura muku da बिल ɗin kai tsaye.','Not connected to Zinn Digital® yet.'=>'Ba a haɗa da Zinn Digital® ba tukuna.','Add this site\'s ID and token from your Zinn Digital® dashboard, or switch to your own provider key to run without an account.'=>'Ƙara ID da alamar wannan rukunin yanar gizon daga allon kulawa na Zinn Digital®, ko sauya zuwa maɓallin mai ba da sabis ɗin ku don gudana ba tare da asusu ba.','Connected to Zinn Digital®.'=>'An haɗa zuwa Zinn Digital®.','The translation provider is having a problem.'=>'Mai ba da sabis na fassara yana fuskantar matsala.','Translation is paused — your provider needs attention.'=>'An dakatar da fassarar — mai ba da sabis ɗinku yana buƙatar kulawa.','Translation has not been set up yet.'=>'Ba a saita fassara ba tukuna.','Something went wrong at our end.'=>'Wani abu ya lalace a bangarenmu.','Check their status page'=>'Bincika shafin yanayin su','Fix this on your account'=>'Gyara wannan a kan asusunka','Style preset'=>'Salon salo','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'Wani wurin farawa. Duk wani abu da ke ƙasa yana shige masa gaba.','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'Yi amfani da launuka da girman nawa na kaina','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'Bar wannan a kashe kuma ana amfani da tsarin da aka riga aka saita yadda yake.','Zinn® language switcher'=>'Mai sauya harshe na Zinn®','Let visitors read this page in another language.'=>'Bar baƙi su karanta wannan shafin a wani harshe.','Title'=>'Take','Use the plugin setting'=>'Yi amfani da saitunan plugin','Dropdown'=>'Fitar da jerin abubuwa','Inline list'=>'Jerin layi-layi','Pills'=>'Kwayoyi','Minimal text'=>'Karamin rubutu','Flags and names'=>'Tutar da sunaye','Stacked list'=>'Jerin jerin abubuwa da aka jera','Choose a language'=>'Zaɓi harshe','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Duba bayanan fitowar Zinn Digital®.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Sabuntawar da aka sauke ta gaza gwajin inganci kuma ba a sanya ta ba.','No DeepL API key is saved, so there is nothing to translate with.'=>'Ba a adana maɓallin API na DeepL ba, saboda haka babu abin da za a fassara da shi.','DeepL does not translate into %s. Choose Google Gemini or OpenAI for this language, or connect the site to Zinn Digital®.'=>'DeepL baya fassara zuwa cikin %s. Zaɓi Google Gemini ko OpenAI don wannan harshe, ko kuma haɗa rukunin yanar gizon da Zinn Digital®.','DeepL could not be reached. Nothing was translated and nothing was charged; it will try again on the next pass.'=>'Ba a iya isa ga DeepL ba. Ba a fassara komai ba kuma ba a caje komai ba; zai sake gwadawa a karo na gaba.','Your DeepL character quota is used up for this period. Translation resumes when it resets, or when you raise the limit on your DeepL account.'=>'An ƙare kaso na harafin DeepL ɗinka na wannan lokacin. Fassarar za ta ci gaba idan an sake saita shi, ko idan ka ƙara iyaka a kan asusunka na DeepL.','DeepL answered with something we could not read. Nothing was saved.'=>'DeepL ya ba da amsar da ba za mu iya karanta wa ba. Ba a adana komai ba.','No Google Gemini API key is saved, so there is nothing to translate with.'=>'Ba a adana maɓallin Google Gemini API ba, don haka babu abin da za a fassara da shi.','Google Gemini could not be reached. Nothing was translated and nothing was charged; it will try again on the next pass.'=>'Ba a iya isa ga Google Gemini ba. Ba a fassara komai ba kuma ba a caje komai ba; zai sake gwadawa a karo na gaba.','No OpenAI API key is saved, so there is nothing to translate with.'=>'Ba a adana maɓallin OpenAI API ba, don haka babu abin da za a fassara da shi.','OpenAI could not be reached. Nothing was translated and nothing was charged; it will try again on the next pass.'=>'Ba a iya tuntuɓar OpenAI ba. Ba a fassara komai ba kuma ba a caje komai ba; za a sake gwadawa a karo na gaba.','This site is not connected to Zinn Digital®, so there is nothing to collect. Add the Site ID and token, or switch to your own provider key.'=>'Wannan shafin ba a haɗa shi da Zinn Digital® ba, don haka babu abin da za a tattara. Ƙara ID na Shafi da token, ko canza zuwa maɓallin mai ba da sabis naka.','This site is not connected to Zinn Digital®.'=>'Ba a haɗa wannan shafin da Zinn Digital® ba.','Zinn Digital® could not be reached. Nothing was sent; it will try again on the next pass.'=>'Ba a iya isa ga Zinn Digital® ba. Ba a aika da komai ba; za a sake gwadawa a karo na gaba.','Translation is paused on this site. Check the account is up to date on your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'An Dakatar da fassara a wannan shafin. Tabbatar cewa asusun yana kan lokaci a kan allon sarrafa ku na Zinn Digital®.','Zinn Digital® rejected this site\'s token. Copy it again from the site\'s Translation tab on your dashboard.'=>'Zinn Digital® ta ƙi yarda da alamar wannan shafin. Kwafi ta sake daga shafin Fassarar (Translation) a kan madubin sarrafa ka (dashboard).','Zinn Digital® could not be reached. Your site keeps serving the translations it already has.'=>'Ba a iya tuntuɓar Zinn Digital® ba. Shafinka na ci gaba da ba da fassarorin da yake da su tun da farko.','Zinn Digital® answered with something we could not read. Your site keeps serving the translations it already has.'=>'Zinn Digital® ya mayar da martani da wani abu da ba za mu iya karantawa ba. Shafinka na ci gaba da ba da fassarorin da yake da su tun da farko.']];